rooms_desc ({"This is the entrancehall of the grand-palace. You see a nice sofa on your rightwith a table standing next to it. A large lamp hangs down from the ceilingand fills the room with a mystic light.","You've entered the livingroom. It looks more likea library, because there are books everywhere.A door to the south gives excess to the hall.A door to the east leeds to the study.","You've entered the study of the Great Warrior Debbie.Everywhere you look there are books and papers. In the middleof the room stands a simple desk. This also is loaded with allsorts of books and papers.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","You've entered the beautiful Zen-garden of Debbie.","You think it's wise to leave this room.It's a PK-zone, not to be entered by annoying playersOR WIZZES!","You have entered a huge marble bathroom. There is nothingmuch to see, except for all the gold handle and taps.The towels are put needly in a cupboard left of you.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"This is the entrancehall of the grand-palace","The livingroom","The study of the Great Warrior Debbie","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","The garden.","Leave this room...","This is Debbie's bathroom.",0,0,0,})
